  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-family:impact, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#f00\">床<span style=\"color:#999\">戰</span></span> 地圖</span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:36px\">洞穴</span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:impact, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">作者 <span style=\"color:#800000\">KronixLP &amp; Kazeio<br></span></span></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">免費使用！若使用本地圖請務必提供伺服器IP！<span style=\"color:#800080\"><strong>Discord:</strong> KronixLP#9308 <br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#000\">此圖適用於各類小遊戲伺服器！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">模式：床戰</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\"><span>推薦</span>版本：支援1至4人隊伍</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">座標：0 64 0</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#000\">適用版本：1.7以上全版本</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4座重生島</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">4座鐵礦島</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#000\">1座金礦島（中央）</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#000\">本圖採用經典床戰資源配置：<span style=\"color:#fc0\">黃金</span>、<span style=\"color:#999\">鐵錠</span>、<span style=\"color:#930\">青銅</span>，可自行替換為<span style=\"color:#3cc\">鑽石</span>、<span style=\"color:#808080\">鐵錠</span>與<span style=\"color:#fc0\">黃金</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/S-mEb3_vSiM?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/project/2021/620/13824520_l.webp\" width=\"720\" height=\"450\"></p>",
